   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 303 of the laws of 1999, amending the New York state\nmedical care facilities finance agency act relating to financing health\nfacilities, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S7489",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7489-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §3, Chap 303 of 1999",
    "lawSection": "Public Health",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S7489\n\nSPONSOR: COMRIE\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 303 of the laws of 1999, amending the New York\nstate medical care facilities finance agency act relating to financing\nhealth facilities, in relation to the effectiveness thereof\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo extend various provisions of the public health law related to the New\nYork State medical care facilities finance agency act\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1: Extends section 3 of Chapter 303 of the laws of 1999, which\nrelates to authorizing facilities to lease or purchase from any person\nor corporation one or more health facilities which was financed (in\nwhole or in part) through loans secured by a local developed corpo-\nration.\n\nSection 2: Effective date\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill is necessary to ensure the continuation of specific laws of\ncritical importance to the Department of Health and health care facili-\nties relating to the New York State medical care facilities finance\nagency act in order to avoid the expiration of those laws.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nThis is a new bill.\n\n \nBUDGET IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone noted.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately.\n",
